# Kusto Query Language: Kusto Query Language (KQL) reference (Microsoft); requirements/languages/kusto.md
name     kusto kql
keyword  where project extend summarize by order sort asc desc take limit top join on kind inner leftouter
keyword  union let datatable render count distinct parse mv-expand and or not in has contains startswith
keyword  between ago
builtin  true false now count dcount sum avg min max bin tostring toint strcat iff isnotempty
ident-part     -
line-comment   //
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
prefix   @    : literal
operators  |=<>!~+-*/%.,()[]
calls
